  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Looking for a career‑focused training institution in Dubai with UK‑accredited certification and real career outcomes? Vibe Education might just be your best match. It’s approved by the Dubai government’s Knowledge and Human Development Authority (KHDA) and offers UK-recognised courses and certifications.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At Vibe, you’ll have a friendly and supportive environment. From day one, you’ll be paired with a dedicated Student Experience Manager to ensure you feel heard, supported, and on track.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>While Vibe doesn’t offer accommodation directly, you can find good housing options near the campus.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
